From ef8c4cfeeb968f58c1b94b926904a365282490d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mayi <3363523343@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:52:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(osdrv/wifi): add and install the persistent STA service

Add the complete standalone STA feature: ioctl controller, scan/connect/status handling, module DHCP event synchronization to Linux IP/route/DNS, private saved configuration and boot/shutdown lifecycle.

Include build targets and system/wifi runtime installation in this same patch; do not require a later installation patch. BSP wifi wrapper and S99user integration are committed together with this patch.

Prerequisite: driver feature 0009 plus board Wi-Fi enablement. No optional driver bug-fix or diagnostics patch is needed for this feature to build/install. No real credentials are included.
---
